  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Removes the custom database tables. No migration is required, and the startup crash in 17.0.0 is gone for good.\n\n- Element Type usage is now held in memory and built on first use, so a site where nobody opens the dashboard does no work at all.\n- Removed the umbElementFinderUsage and umbElementFinderState tables and the package migration that created them. Installing no longer depends on unattended package migrations being enabled.\n- Fixed: sites no longer fail to start with \"Invalid object name 'umbElementFinderState'\".\n- Usage counts now refresh correctly after content is trashed, restored, moved, or deleted.\n- Upgrading from 17.0.x: the two old tables are left in place and can safely be dropped by hand.",
